OL,11,     Ffrom the Celtic countries and
OL,12,     Fbeyond.
OL,13,G2200 Beverley's World of Music
OL,14,     FThe finest musical melodies,
OL,15,     Fexquisite performances from stage
OL,16,     Fand screen, and orchestral and
OL,17,     Fchoral works from Wales and the
OL,18,     Fworld. There's no need to book
OL,19,     Fyour seat, just listen and relax.
